    <title>vol.24不断亲不绝交，在令人烦恼的原生家庭里我们还能做什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b2941484bce022f91b7cf4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b2941484bce022f91b7cf4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Mar 2026 10:42:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很久不见！今天我们聊一期家庭生活，灵感来自过年高强度的家庭相处！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> “爸爸妈妈，我和你们沟通的唯一筹码，就是您的不忍啊！”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 姐姐冲锋陷阵：从双眼皮到婚前同居，我要战斗！塔塔开！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 姐姐的战斗理论：《家人博弈学》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 妹妹暗度陈仓：从话疗奶奶到父母调停，用魔法打败魔法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> &nbsp;妹妹比鲁迅更伟大：当女人遇到祥林嫂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 姐妹组合拳应用案例：姐姐的男友回乡记&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1824">30:24</a> 幻想派vs现实派 人真的是不可被改变的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a> 在父母调停上的姐妹配合&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> 母女之间的“看见” ，家庭是最小单位的女性主义</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
