  <item>
    <title>vol.23 《杀夫》vs“酱园弄悬案”：女作家如何改写詹周氏杀夫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68562bb14abe6e29cb3a24d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68562bb14abe6e29cb3a24d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Jun 2025 04:05:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！这是【姐妹夜谈】的新栏目【姐妹夜读】，每期我们会认真地和大家读一本书，从女性的角度和大家聊文学~</span></p><span></span><p><span>（姐：中文系领域展开！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>今天我们要读的书是台湾作家李昂的小说《杀夫》，这本书有一个广为人知的原型，那就是正在上映的电影《酱园弄·悬案》的原型：民国四大奇案之一的酱园弄杀夫案。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们将从原型故事出发，一起来看看【女作家】是如何【重写】这个故事的……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> 原型案件还原：詹周氏杀夫案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 苏青：《为杀夫者辩》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> 李昂写《杀夫》，竟然是看了假新闻？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 李昂家的三姐妹：女作家为何改掉自己的名字里的女性化字眼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 鹿港小镇，其实就是福建农村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 《杀夫》讲了个什么故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 【人物一】被杀者杀猪陈：似人非人的屠夫，在人性与兽性之间游走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> 现代社会做到了‘君子远庖厨’，兽性的恶隐藏办公室里、在家庭里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 【人物二】杀人者林市：一个如此软弱麻木的女主，是一个好主角吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 自己的名字很重要，冠姓权很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> 饥饿与性：生存沦为交易，女性身体被“物化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> “不要骂我阿母”“不要干我阿母”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 【人物三】农村里的其他男女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 妓女金花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 性压抑的窥淫寡妇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 【人物四】讲故事的人 who lives who dies who tell the story？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> 话语是重要的权力 ！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2998">49:58</a> 《杀夫》是弱女叙事吗？《房思琪的初恋乐园》会减弱女性主义的力量吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3549">59:09</a> 期待《酱园弄·悬案》会怎么拍，拍得不好专门骂一期</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听众群~一起聊聊天！（如过期请后台私信！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFYe4q0ug-MiZCX48krkejGqO9C.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6407e17aa3cec87686c5f0e6/lj2UJEBt1kk0FMCLv2kvQKTvCOwe.m4a" length="59566391" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrjwHgJrUY9XsmLUIBZqNGij_NfG.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.22 好的旅行与厕所有关，与小红书无关</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68372e7438dcc57c647793cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68372e7438dcc57c647793cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 15:55:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期为日本旅行的姐妹篇：如何做攻略才能收获最好的旅行体验？如何在小红书信息洪流中筛选真实信息？如何打开感官，融入当地，快乐旅行？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天邀请到的嘉宾是 “超级爱旅行也超级会旅行的可可”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 可可攻略设计的越南之行，让姐姐一生难忘！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> J人旅行前：先学一年越南语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 小众论坛：背包客栈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 2017坐火车去越南，过海关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 2025年去西班牙，在小红书做“厕所侠”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 出门在外，找厕所的秘籍（？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 如何找到小众、前卫、高质量的当地景点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> “打开感官”，才是旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> &nbsp;去一个地方旅行之前，先看一本设定在当地的小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a> “想你的风还是吹到了怡保”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 家学渊源：首先你需要一对爱旅行的爸妈，才能成为旅行大师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 妹：一人游，独属于自己的惬意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> &nbsp;姐：多人旅行，超绝浪漫的化学反应！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 多人旅行，怎么分配工作量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 多人旅行胜出！因为可以点很多菜每人吃一口！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 日本旅行搭子，姐妹互夸环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 【最实用的一集】如何在小红书的海洋里挖到宝藏景点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 怎么利用避雷帖找到自己需要的信息？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2691">44:51</a> 怎么找饭店？可可最擅长的领域！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a> 蹲在马路上吃一个土耳烤肉卷，这就是年轻时穷游的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">57:44</a> 旅行的意义是什么？发生一些意料之外的事，比如突然开始唱歌……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3593">59:53</a> 在自己居住的城市，也能旅行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3676">01:01:16</a> &nbsp;妹妹和学姐的浪漫故事：在临别的黎明破晓前爱上福州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">01:04:07</a> 下一段旅程！下个路口见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3984">01:06:24</a> 彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、西班牙“厕所侠”原帖：</span></p><span></span><p><span>57 吉啦多发布了一篇小红书笔记，快来看吧！ 😆 HThxXe14YHWJf30 😆 <a data-url="http://xhslink.com/a/4Ljj6yRWptDdb" href="http://xhslink.com/a/4Ljj6yRWptDdb">xhslink.com</a>，复制本条信息，打开【小红书】App查看精彩内容！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、西班牙国家自然博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjAwcy9QLQr8VxZ9c7YwEu4poTt6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5LS_H0O5RlRX5ctmQH3TXskPJh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>两栋分开的建筑，中间路途指引是动物爪印</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqfyKRsOfQaQkQZqpH-lQTNTbdoA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3、西班牙Museo de la Ciencia Cosmo Caixa</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fse6HrDby1xfTtzyzjDGPiS-H9ue.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGMQDSsWAKeLEmsLQ3KdRscp4_A.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>4、马来西亚：我在怡保很想你</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbJaUOjgON_Wc1XRRI-L7xIdieR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《下个路口见》李宇春</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>特邀嘉宾：可可</span></p>]]></description>
