  <item>
    <title>vol 18. 天天向上：裸辞之后，才看清梦想的真相</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677e8d2ccda04ef4c15d0044</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677e8d2ccda04ef4c15d0044</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2025 14:49:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【“人生是旷野！但也不一定”】第三期</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾是姐姐中文系的老朋友天天。她从影视行业转行到互联网，又从互联网大厂裸辞，做了几天自媒体博主却发现“离职赛道”已经人满为患……</span></p><span></span><p><span>从小立志追求文艺梦想的女孩，居然在“裸辞”的这场修行中，收获了“梦想”的真相，这何尝不是一个充满戏剧性的好故事？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>她依然像她的名字一样，在分不清东南西北的人生旷野里，天天向上！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 一张纸巾：2020年，两个中文系追逐影视梦的女孩的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>（聊天时记错成2019年了，幸好翻出了照片！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqOjyLfw_fsqhrfwLn2h89WXazx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 2020年之后，写下这些话后的天天又经历了什么？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 梦开始的地方：十几岁就确定了做电影的梦想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> &nbsp;吐槽艺考，生不逢时！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> step1.秋招拿到了国内顶级电影制作公司的offer，但放弃了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> step2. 影视行业体制内工作：更是顶级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> step3. 影视互联网大厂，我来了！——我走了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 吐槽影视行业资源垄断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> step.4 裸辞：下定决心辞职的瞬间&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> 为什么上班会越上越忙？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 【关于裸辞】 一场被迫面对自己的修行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 自媒体的尝试，离职博主的赛道上人满为患</span></p><span></span><p><span>（</span><a href=" http://xhslink.com/a/rVOh70quMKi3" data-url=" http://xhslink.com/a/rVOh70quMKi3"><span>天天的试水作品：《大厂螺丝工罢工实录</span></a><span>》 ）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 直面深渊：对儿时梦想祛魅之后，该往哪里去？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> 创作梦想和工作彻底解绑&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2656">44:16</a> 一个学姐的故事：她曾是我们的灯塔，却也选择做人间烛火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> “梦想”有时也是一种毒药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2966">49:26</a> 解构“梦想”：梦想远没有我们的生活重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> step5. 找一份性价比更高的工作，被梦想的子弹击倒在地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 00后一代，更不敢追梦了（妹妹被两个姐姐疯狂恐吓？）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a> 悲观主义在00后中成为了一种时尚单品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3776">62:56</a> 工作和梦想解绑后，还有空间追求梦想吗？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4029">67:09</a> “人生是旷野”过气了 ？我不再幻想了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4439">73:59</a> 最后，谈谈衰老感&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4510">75:10</a> 给初入职场小白的建议：为你的简历工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:《life is》（《好东西》插曲）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
