  <item>
    <title>vol.17 拳击初体验：管他好事坏事，先吃老娘一拳！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fac8ce81cdab3a9335ab9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fac8ce81cdab3a9335ab9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！最近妹妹解锁了人生新体验，打拳击！！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>哐哐打拳，猛猛爽到。今天，和大家聊聊【打拳】这件事！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 一切都从《热辣滚烫》开始，种下了一个种子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 恐惧冲突压抑自己的人，在拳击时挥出全力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 打拳初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 体能废物也能打拳击吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a> 运动是有确定性回报的，身体会回答你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 打拳击和举铁健身有什么区别？有什么优点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 身体状态的改变：终于理解秀肌肉的油腻男了 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 体能的提高：50个开合跳曾经是我的极限&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 运动给心态带来的变化：管他好事坏事，先吃老娘一拳！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 妹妹小剧场：用无敌自信把美容推销干懵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 女人展现攻击力的途径很珍贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 小红书广告：同名账号“姐妹夜谈” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《black sheep》</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
