  <item>
    <title>vol.16 超级天下无敌炒鸡蛋：爱抽象！更爱大象！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dda360bfd7110df41e116d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dda360bfd7110df41e116d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Sep 2024 13:15:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【“人生是旷野！但也不一定”】第二期</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请到了B站知名up主“超级天下无敌炒鸡蛋”来分享她丰富多彩、抽象离奇的生活！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在和炒鸡蛋的聊天过程中，我们反复在“笑鼠”和“萌晕”两种状态里反复横跳，也意外发现了这个充满勇气的脑洞天才背后更加真实、可爱的一面。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>人生是旷野，每个人都有自己的修行。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 嘉宾介绍，三个enfp炸场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 炒鸡蛋印象最深刻的抽象事</span></p><span></span><p><span>传送门：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hw411K7eU/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Hw411K7eU/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>【澳洲留学】和2500个人一起裸体在海边看日出 然后衣服找不到了&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> 做视频博主的契机是什么？老天爷赏素材吃！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> &nbsp;经典黄色小人是怎么出现的？做自媒体需要鲜明的个人形象！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpk_3Y-NU4w4nd2uz2lV8wlPbXek.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> 在国外，不止是抽象，也有危险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> 让炒鸡蛋产生“妈妈我要回家”的离谱事件大分享</span><strong><span>（非常好笑！）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 2022年6月24日，世界上最邪恶的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 在澳洲麦当劳可以吃到小孩肉（……）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 如何处理现实生活的压力？——没办法处理。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 炒鸡蛋不为人知的梦想职业竟然是……！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 炒鸡蛋怎么看待“人生是旷野”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 炒鸡蛋心路历程分享：我做博主是一种选择&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 姐妹滑跪：为我们的浅薄道歉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 炒鸡蛋：所谓自由豁达，也是天时地利人和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 对未来迷茫的年轻人，炒鸡蛋的建议是……？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 炒鸡蛋讲故事之《土著看电影》 &amp;最爱的动漫</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《水手花园》</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：妹妹</span></p>]]></description>
