  <item>
    <title>vol.15 P人：人生是旷野！J人：我要上哈佛。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c4b53433591c27be86b2a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c4b53433591c27be86b2a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2024 15:24:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【</span><strong><span>“人生是旷野！但也不一定”</span></strong><span>新栏目上线！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会邀请一些嘉宾来为大家分享她们精彩的生活，希望能够为每一位对未来感到迷茫的朋友点一盏亮光，对现在的生活感到痛苦的朋友们带来改变的勇气！欢迎大家多多互动，你们的每一条评论都让我和姐姐感觉到无比的幸福！】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！本期嘉宾：绝顶J人璐璐小姐。</span><strong><span>（公众号：何小璐）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>声音很甜，决心很硬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>转专业、找工作、申法硕、辞职……</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一个选择都惊心动魄，又都在她的掌握之中。她是怎么做到的？欢迎来到“两个p人走进科学之——J人的世界。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 成年人的暑假，真的好爽！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 当人真正快乐时，需要的东西其实很少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 选错专业怎么办？在中文系辩论队发现了法学天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a> 给P人一点J人震撼：辞职去美国读法硕的决定，本科时就想好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 计划被打乱怎么办？申请季赶上了疫情，办签证赶上了封城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 忙到崩溃的在职备考，J人惊人的执行力竟然来自……！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 哈佛生活大分享：哈佛教给我如何正确休息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> J人必修课之“学习P人” &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a> 职业选择：从“资本家的走狗”到“正义的使者”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3241">54:01</a> 如何做出不后悔的“正确”选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> 记日记——反思生活的好方法 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> 在“历史垃圾时间”，理性计划还能奏效吗？这是不是一个无法计划的时代？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4250">70:50</a> 永远不要害怕做出改变！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Roll the dice</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频剪辑：妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
