    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoXIcZF7eWDBkrwtbpkKvykt239U.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.14 独生子女知道我们有亲姐妹这么爽吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66753affb6a841272959eb4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66753affb6a841272959eb4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 08:34:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>首先为标题的大胆冒犯道个歉，just玩梗！</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>本期是姐姐妹妹线下相聚的特别节目《姐妹茶话会》，大家可能会听到觥筹交错的背景音，希望大家能感受到与我们同在一方空间之内聊天！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期聊的话题是</span><strong><span>“亲姐妹”</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在独生子女的一代，有一个相差八岁的亲姐妹是怎么样的体验？从中我们获得了怎样的成长？又留下了怎样的回忆呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 2017&amp;2024 姐姐和妹妹的毕业典礼&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 阶段一：姐妹对彼此的初印象（？）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 让妹妹心灵受伤的十二岁生日宴会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> &nbsp;让姐姐心灵受伤的十一岁生日宴会（姐姐的生日会是有什么诅咒吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 姐姐的爱：妹妹半夜惊醒：“我真该死啊！”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 阶段二：小领导和小跟班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 阶段三：两个成年人之间的平等交流（烂梗出处）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 不着调的姐姐和敏感独立的妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 为什么我们两个性格如此倒反天罡？？？ 原来是......!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 亲姐妹的奇怪用处之一：鉴男友/crush</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 大离谱：姐姐谈恋爱，妹妹崩溃大哭 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> &nbsp;亲姐妹的奇怪用处之二：在家庭矛盾中相互配合，打好“时代组合拳”（？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 亲姐妹的奇怪用处之三：填补对方的性格缺陷 相互救赎磕到了（？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 关系好的重要原因：我们都是女的！！！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> 一种非“权力-服从”、平等尊重的全新的家人关系&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 90后和00后：两代人的烙印在我们身上展现</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：《As It Was》</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj94W7T07HFfrUS6zXOENzzvfAn0.m4a" length="40671045" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiM-fNnN0EbdIZcXfjGSlJ58F3wC.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.13 姐妹做播客一年多，最意想不到的竟是....(不是没人听)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6650387ac59d1e575760d06a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6650387ac59d1e575760d06a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 May 2024 06:49:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>安迪·沃霍尔 曾经做出预言：“每个人都能出名15分钟”。在新媒体时代，人人都能做博主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“姐妹夜谈”成立一年半，和大家聊聊这一年半的感受，以及如果你也有做播客的打算，需要准备什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 做播客在【物质】上需要准备什么？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 做播客在【心理】上需要准备什么？（更加重要）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 《姐妹夜谈》的历史来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 羞耻感：妹妹不敢做播客的心理障碍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 落差感：一开始就要想清楚播客的定位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> 做播客最大的意外收获：父母更理解我们了！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 播客：是和世界沟通方式的延伸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 《中文互联网正在加速崩塌》：几年之后，我们创作的内容将烟消云散</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 自媒体内容稍纵即逝，《姐妹夜谈》的意义在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> &nbsp;临终愿望：再播放一次“姐妹夜谈”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 每个人都应该有自己的口述史&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> 土豆网：每个人都是生活的导演 、百度贴吧、人人网</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 电子存档，赛博盖坟&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 为了自己而做的自媒体</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《河流》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;提到的毛冬播客：《基本无害》声音纪录片</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls4QhKuHymsPpuFzSW7IzDguIlGH.m4a" length="35859416" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiwJhHk9hosGtda_LPe0IZNozeql.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol12.六年后再看《延禧宫略》：职场小人物生存启示录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662b0f3f6a3c2ef095c710d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662b0f3f6a3c2ef095c710d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Apr 2024 02:19:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这段时间姐妹相聚很少，原因是妹妹步入了人生新阶段：实习和找工作！（被社会拷打）</span></p><span></span><p><span>正式步入社畜生活的妹妹，有很多困惑和不安，姐姐也不禁想起她五六年前找工作的艰难岁月，想起那时陪伴我们的《延禧宫略》……</span></p><span></span><p><span>正在这时，《延禧宫略》就在2024年的互联网重新翻红了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是，姐妹俩六年后重看《延禧宫略》，过去看乐子，如今照镜子，这原来是一部职场启示录！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 职场新人的苦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 妹妹保持好心态的法宝：《我在废土世界扫垃圾》里的祝宁和《延禧宫略》里的魏璎珞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 2019年姐姐在找工作痛苦期看《延禧》，“姐妹夜谈”诞生了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 魏姐，充满魅力的魏姐！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 【本期整活】姐妹小剧场：重现魏姐三大高光时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 魏璎珞vs张嬷嬷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 魏璎珞vs愉嫔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 魏璎珞vs继后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 职场里能保持“真心”是最可贵的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 如今社会推崇“真心无用，搞钱第一” &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 魏璎珞是如何做到在宫斗中保持“初心”的？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> 魏璎珞与皇帝是真情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 人在职场，就像人在后宫，最难的都是不被体制同化、异化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 《延禧宫略》告诉我们：工作是工作，生活是生活！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 皇帝（领导）画饼，规训后妃（下属）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> 在你快要屈服的时候，魏姐会叉着腰站出来，敲醒你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 《金枝欲孽》里的如妃：被后宫异化的可怜人 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 【求职彩蛋】</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：《雪落下的声音》《看》&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
