    <title>vol.11 《热辣滚烫》：当一个女孩决定去死</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d0c10d35dd8780eddecd35</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d0c10d35dd8780eddecd35</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Feb 2024 14:22:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！姐妹终于过年回家见面了，终于能坐在一起聊天了（然而妹妹却觉得第一次直视姐姐聊天十分尴尬==）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年姐妹带着爸妈选择了贺岁片《热辣滚烫》，哭成两个泪人，二刷之后，我们坐下来，想认真夸一夸贾玲和这部电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期搭配上一期 ⌈减肥⌋ 食用更佳）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 拜年失败（建议跳过）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 引用张春影评：</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/review/15753907/?_dtcc=1" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/review/15753907/?_dtcc=1"><span>有了力量之后，我们的野心要往何处去</span></a><span> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> </span><strong><span>⟦上半部⟧：一个女孩是如何被杀死的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 被家庭利用 ：丰富多彩的、有野心有欲望的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 被恋人利用：平凡自大、大脑空空的男性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 女主角前期的“托付心态”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 被其他男性性剥削：被骚扰和长相、穿着没有任何关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 合格的男性搭档 何坤教练：专业、有边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 被朋友利用&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 为什么贾玲拍闺蜜抢男友就没有“雌竞”感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 对原版《百元之恋》的女主人设改编&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> </span><strong><span>⟦下半部⟧：一个女孩重获新生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> “不想再死一次”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> “我想再活一次”：是身上的肉救了她&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> &nbsp;杜乐莹爱上拳击是必然吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 《百元之恋》和《热辣滚烫》中“疼”的意象不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 乐莹想要的是一个平等尊重的拥抱&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 讨好型人格恐惧冲突，这正是拳击的魅力&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> &nbsp;《百元之恋》和《热辣滚烫》中“赢”的意义不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> &nbsp;《百元之恋》和《热辣滚烫》中女主角是如何告别男主角的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 原来天降紫微星就是她！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 她变了，减肥只是副产品，拳击只是催化剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 看完《热辣滚烫》，还没找到自己，怎么办？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>（彩蛋：贾玲和张小斐不会是真的吧？？）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 大张伟《只为自己开的花》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
